          "unit_id": "external-unit:curated-source:zhihu_selected_observation:ea9b75e32b8c49f0:8:69e04b385bce0686",
          "text": "中游竞争已从传统规模制造，转向“NPI导入、复杂测试、良率爬坡、自动化产线和规模交付”的综合工程能力比拼。",
          "unit_hash": "69e04b385bce0686c5373674ac328df1e2c65340f731d017caaffecceb4520e3",
          "source_id": "curated-source:zhihu_selected_observation:ea9b75e32b8c49f0",
          "source_ordinal": 8,
          "source_block_hash": "fc8054153631d4a59f862362133f3ecf0b908aff634cb1c83a0c15d2c9b1785b",
          "evidence_status": "source_unit_verified",
          "citation_refs": [
