        },
        {
          "schema_version": "curated_external_source_unit.v1",
          "unit_id": "external-unit:curated-source:zhihu_selected_observation:ea9b75e32b8c49f0:9:abb5bced708f9b51",
          "text": "谁能更早完成样品验证、客户认证和稳定量产，谁就能在价格下行前锁定订单和利润。",
          "unit_hash": "abb5bced708f9b51426cb629c9cee621650ffb63f2fdf78916372f6b6b3728d4",
          "source_id": "curated-source:zhihu_selected_observation:ea9b75e32b8c49f0",
          "source_ordinal": 9,
          "source_block_hash": "fc8054153631d4a59f862362133f3ecf0b908aff634cb1c83a0c15d2c9b1785b",
          "evidence_status": "source_unit_verified",
          "citation_refs": [
            6
          ]
        },
        {
          "schema_version": "curated_external_source_unit.v1",
          "unit_id": "external-unit:curated-source:zhihu_selected_observation:ea9b75e32b8c49f0:10:67d04a4ca88e74dd",
          "text": "资料来源：头豹研究院 03 1.6T时代功耗与散热成为限制项，硅光提供底层集成能力，LPO/NPO/CPO分别对应不同工程化路径 随着光模块从800G向1.6T演进，行业瓶颈不再只是单通道速率提升，而是DSP功耗、信号完整性、封装复杂度、散热压力和系统级能效同步上升。",
          "unit_hash": "67d04a4ca88e74dda99a5dab33832c2713426e8aa028f21b9843c2869d4b890c",
          "source_id": "curated-source:zhihu_selected_observation:ea9b75e32b8c49f0",
          "source_ordinal": 10,
          "source_block_hash": "fc8054153631d4a59f862362133f3ecf0b908aff634cb1c83a0c15d2c9b1785b",
          "evidence_status": "source_unit_verified",
          "citation_refs": [
            6
